        <div id="calendar" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">2. When Black Friday 2026 Treadmill Deals Start</h2>
<p>
            The fixed dates are simple. <strong>Thanksgiving is Thursday 26 November 2026, Black
            Friday is Friday 27 November and Cyber Monday is Monday 30 November.</strong> The sale
            itself is not confined to those days, and for treadmills it rarely has been.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Amazon typically opens its Black Friday event about a week before the day
            itself.</strong> Press coverage of last year's event put its start on 20 November 2025,
            running into the start of December. Amazon had not announced its 2026 dates when we
            checked on 28 October, and it often does not confirm them far in advance, so treat the
            week of 16 November as the point to start checking daily rather than as a known start
            date.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>The makers are already running sales, and those are not Black Friday
            prices.</strong> On 28 October NordicTrack's Commercial 1750 page carried a "save 20% and
            free shipping" banner, UREVO's store header advertised a Halloween sale, and the Strol 2E
            page still showed a back-to-school banner whose countdown had run out. Fitness brands
            rotate named promotions through most of the year. That is useful, because it tells you
            what the machine normally sells for — the baseline any Black Friday price has to beat.
          </p>
          <p>A practical timeline for this year:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Now to mid-November:</strong> shortlist two or three machines and write down what each sells for at Amazon and one other retailer, with the delivery tier you would choose.</li>
            <li><strong>Week of 16 November:</strong> early deals often appear. Check your shortlist daily; a price that meets your target now is as good as one on the day.</li>
            <li><strong>Thursday 26 to Monday 30 November:</strong> the main window. Prices can move within a day, and the most discounted stock can sell out.</li>
            <li><strong>December:</strong> some reductions continue, but freight delivery for full-size treadmills tends to lengthen. If the machine is a gift, check the delivery estimate on the order page before you buy.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Our guide to the
            <a href="/best-time-of-year-to-buy-a-treadmill/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">best time of year to buy a treadmill</a>
            covers the rest of the calendar, including why the first two weeks of January are a poor
            time to buy and the second half is a reasonable one.
          </p>
        </div>

