          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">For most people, the Horizon T101 Connect at $600 or less is the
            Black Friday 2026 treadmill to watch</strong>; runners should watch the Horizon 7.0 AT
            at $850 or less, and anyone who wants iFIT and decline the NordicTrack Commercial 1750
            at $1,700 or less. On a smaller budget, the NordicTrack T Series 5 under $480 is a real
            treadmill, and the walking pads are only deals below the prices they already sell at.
          </p>
